Here is the **complete, step-by-step implementation guide for Task 1: Basics of Web Development** based on the ApexPlanet Internship roadmap.

---

# 🚀 Task 1: Basics of Web Development

* **Timeline:** Days 1–9
* **Technologies:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
* **Core Objectives:**
  1. **HTML:** Create a web page structure using headings, paragraphs, images, and hyper-links.
  2. **CSS:** Apply styling including custom fonts, color schemes, spacing (padding/margin), and layout adjustments.
  3. **JavaScript:** Add basic interactivity (a button click triggering an alert).

---

## 🏗️ Technical Architecture & Component Flow

```text
[ HTML File (index.html) ]  <--- Structural Content (Headings, Paragraphs, Images, Links)
          │
          ├──> Linked to [ CSS File (style.css) ]    <--- Visual Styling (Colors, Spacing, Layout)
          │
          └──> Linked to [ JS File (script.js) ]     <--- Behavior (Button Click Alert)
```

---

## 📂 Project Directory Structure

Create a folder on your computer named `Task-1-Basics` with the following structure:

```text
Task-1-Basics/
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── script.js
```

---

## 💻 Step-by-Step Code Implementation

### Step 1: Create the HTML Structure (`index.html`)

This file contains all required elements: headings (`<h1>`, `<h2>`), paragraphs (`<p>`), an image (`<img>`), a link (`<a>`), and an interactive button (`<button>`).

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Task 1 - Personal Intro Webpage</title>
    <!-- Linking External CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card-container">
        <!-- Heading -->
        <h1 class="main-title">Welcome to My First Webpage</h1>

        <!-- Image Component -->
        <div class="image-wrapper">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Profile Avatar" id="profile-img">
        </div>

        <!-- Subheading & Paragraph -->
        <h2>About This Project</h2>
        <p class="description">
            This webpage was created as part of <strong>Task 1 (Basics of Web Development)</strong> for the ApexPlanet Internship. 
            It demonstrates basic semantic HTML structure, custom CSS layout and styling, and simple JavaScript interactivity.
        </p>

        <!-- Hyperlink -->
        <div class="link-section">
            <p>Visit the official internship portal: 
                <a href="https://apexplanet.in" target="_blank" class="custom-link">ApexPlanet Official Website</a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Button for JavaScript -->
        <div class="action-section">
            <button id="alertBtn" class="btn">Click Me for a Greeting!</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Linking External JavaScript -->
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### Step 2: Apply CSS Styling (`style.css`)

This stylesheet provides centered alignment, custom typography, background colors, spacing adjustments, and button hover states.

```css
/* General Page Reset & Setup */
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background-color: #f4f7f6;
    color: #333333;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 20px;
}

/* Card Container Layout */
.card-container {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    max-width: 500px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
}

/* Headings Styling */
.main-title {
    color: #2c3e50;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h2 {
    color: #34495e;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* Image Styling */
.image-wrapper {
    margin: 20px 0;
}

#profile-img {
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid #3498db;
    object-fit: cover;
}

/* Paragraph Styling */
.description {
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555555;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

/* Hyperlink Styling */
.link-section {
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.custom-link {
    color: #3498db;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

.custom-link:hover {
    color: #1d6fa5;
    text-decoration: underline;
}

/* Button & Hover Styling */
.btn {
    background-color: #2ecc71;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
    background-color: #27ae60;
}

.btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
}
```

---

### Step 3: Add JavaScript Interactivity (`script.js`)

This file handles the button click event and pops up an alert box on interaction.

```javascript
// Wait for the DOM content to fully load
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {

    // Select the button element by its ID
    const alertButton = document.getElementById('alertBtn');

    // Add a click event listener
    alertButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
        alert(' Hello! You have successfully completed Task 1: Basics of Web Development!');
    });

});
```

---

## 🔍 Implementation Verification Checklist

| Element / Requirement | Applied Code / Feature | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :---: |
| **HTML Headings** | `<h1>` and `<h2>` elements | ✅ |
| **HTML Paragraph** | `<p class="description">` containing description | ✅ |
| **HTML Image** | `<img id="profile-img">` element | ✅ |
| **HTML Link** | `<a class="custom-link">` pointing to external URL | ✅ |
| **CSS Styling** | Color variables, margins, padding, border-radius, shadows | ✅ |
| **JS Interactivity** | `addEventListener` on button triggering `alert()` | ✅ |

---

## 📤 Official Task Submission Steps (ApexPlanet Workflow)

Follow these exact steps from the internship guidelines to submit your completed Task 1:

1. **GitHub Repository Upload:**
   * Create a public GitHub repository named `ApexPlanet-Task-1`.
   * Upload `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js`.
   * Copy your **Public GitHub Repository Link**.

2. **Screen Recording:**
   * Use screen recording software (e.g., OBS Studio, Windows Game Bar, or Loom).
   * Record a video showing your code in the editor and interacting with the live browser preview (clicking the alert button).

3. **LinkedIn Upload:**
   * Log into LinkedIn.
   * Post your screen recording video and feature it under the **"Featured"** section of your profile.
   * Copy the **LinkedIn Post/Video Link**.

4. **Submit on ApexPlanet Portal:**
   * Go to [ApexPlanet Internship Portal](https://apexplanet.in).
   * Register/Log in and navigate to **"Manage Task"**.
   * Verify using your **Offer Letter ID** and **Registered Email**.
   * Select **Task 1**, paste your **GitHub Link** and **LinkedIn Video Link**, then click **Submit**.
